  message: "Scope revision (2026-04-23): Level 1's localized framework_patterns.py bug fix belongs to WI-zigah, not here. Level 2's role on framework_patterns.py is REFACTOR-TO-SHARED-UTILITY, not bug fix. Revised scope:\n1. Build NameMatcher utility (canonical-form tuples, source-spelling variants).\n2. REFACTOR framework_patterns.py to call NameMatcher instead of its local normalization from WI-zigah.\n3. Retrofit di_resolution.py (line 641 interface-name lookup).\n4. Audit io_boundary.py lookup_with_module (line 833) — may already canonicalize; if so, document and skip.\n5. Lint/test rule flagging raw regex/string matching against symbol-meta in matcher code paths.\n6. Polyglot coverage fixture (one file per language × top import/call constructs) + property test."  # 231b
